        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-0c9cd3aa-38d8-4e78-85c2-7fba7217988e",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Your canopy tour begins at 10:30. Follow a route of zip lines and platforms above the jungle and a mountain river. Four to five instructors accompany the group and help you on the platforms. The longest zip lines are on the final four sections of the course. You can see waterfalls along the way.\n\nAt 13:00, visit a coffee plantation and taste Geisha coffee, the most expensive coffee Panama exports."
